 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Every deal is different.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 1.404
  },
  {
   "text": "Your battlecard isn't.",
   "start": 1.95,
   "end": 3.297
  },
  {
   "text": "A CFO wants price. I.T. wants integrations. A renewal needs a defence.",
   "start": 3.9,
   "end": 9.798
  },
  {
   "text": "Your rep gets one generic card, and makes up the rest.",
   "start": 10.158,
   "end": 13.269
  },
  {
   "text": "Battlecards fixes that.",
   "start": 13.869,
   "end": 15.866
  },
  {
   "text": "Name your rivals.",
   "start": 16.136,
   "end": 17.669
  },
  {
   "text": "Weeks of scattered research. Reviews, forums, news, pricing pages, pulled together in about two minutes.",
   "start": 18.209,
   "end": 24.664
  },
  {
   "text": "Current. Cited. Structured by what wins deals.",
   "start": 25.114,
   "end": 29.015
  },
  {
   "text": "Now tell it about your deal.",
   "start": 29.615,
   "end": 31.333
  },
  {
   "text": "Size. Prospect. Stage. Buyer. Situation.",
   "start": 31.633,
   "end": 35.813
  },
  {
   "text": "In seconds, the card rebuilds around it.",
   "start": 36.293,
   "end": 38.661
  },
  {
   "text": "A CFO negotiating? Pricing and objections lead.",
   "start": 39.201,
   "end": 43.381
  },
  {
   "text": "I.T. in discovery? Integrations, and your sharpest questions.",
   "start": 43.891,
   "end": 48.256
  },
  {
   "text": "Every point links to its proof.",
   "start": 48.796,
   "end": 50.886
  },
  {
   "text": "Send the link, and your rep walks in with a card built for this deal.",
   "start": 51.486,
   "end": 55.573
  },
  {
   "text": "Battlecards.",
   "start": 56.233,
   "end": 57.115
  },
  {
   "text": "A card for every deal, not just every competitor.",
   "start": 57.475,
   "end": 60.586
  }
 ]
